menu "G-code Parser Configuration"

config GCODE_PARSER_SELF_TEST
    bool "Run G-code parser self-test on boot"
    default n
    help
        When enabled, the firmware runs all 30 G-code parser unit tests
        during startup (before protocol stack init) and prints PASS/FAIL
        results to the serial console.  End summary line:
        "SELF-TEST DONE: <n>/30 PASS".

        This is for on-target verification only.  Keep disabled in
        production firmware (adds ~2KB flash, zero runtime overhead
        when disabled).

endmenu
